Subject: [PATCH 2/3] Bluetooth: Reassigned copyright to Code Aurora Forum
Date: Fri, 28 May 2010 11:53:46 -0400
Message-Id: <1275062027-27872-3-git-send-email-rshaffer@codeaurora.org>
In-Reply-To: <1275062027-27872-1-git-send-email-rshaffer@codeaurora.org>
